sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Cron (every 30 min)
  participant W as Worker
  participant M as Your mailbox (IMAP)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant L as Ollama
  C->>W: email.poll
  W->>M: search allow-listed senders since last run
  M-->>W: messages
  W->>DB: skip known Message-IDs
  alt job alert
    W->>W: extract job links, create stub Jobs
    W->>DB: Job needs-description flag
  else application update
    W->>L: classify (ack / interview / reject)
    L-->>W: status + confidence
    W->>DB: ApplicationEvent source=EMAIL_PARSER
    W->>DB: suggest status change (you confirm)
  end
